{'symbol': 'TSCO', 'date': '2022-12-15 10:00:00', 'title': 'TRACTOR SUPPLY RELEASES 2021 TASK FORCE ON CLIMATE-RELATED FINANCIAL DISCLOSURES REPORT', 'text': "BRENTWOOD, TENN.--( BUSINESS WIRE )--TRACTOR SUPPLY COMPANY (NASDAQ: TSCO), THE LARGEST RURAL LIFESTYLE RETAILER IN THE UNITED STATES, TODAY RELEASED ITS 2021 TASK FORCE ON CLIMATE-RELATED FINANCIAL DISCLOSURES (“TCFD”) REPORT. FOR THE THIRD CONSECUTIVE YEAR, THE REPORT IS ALIGNED WITH THE TCFD'S RECOMMENDATIONS FOR CLIMATE DISCLOSURE AND INCLUDES INFORMATION ON TRACTOR SUPPLY'S OPERATIONS STRUCTURED AROUND FOUR THEMATIC AREAS: GOVERNANCE, STRATEGY, RISK MANAGEMENT AND METRICS AND TARGETS. TRACTOR SUPPLY HAS SET ABSOLUTE CARBON REDUCTION TARGETS TO REDUCE EMISSIONS FROM ITS OPERATIONS OF 20% BY 2025 AND 50% BY 2030, WITH THE ULTIMATE GOAL OF ACHIEVING NET ZERO EMISSIONS ACROSS ALL OPERATIONS BY 2040."}